text-base text-foreground\">Literary Harbor</span></div><p class=\"text-[11px] leading-relaxed\">A global, rights-aware digital library providing lawful access to public-domain literature, open-access academic books, and open educational resources.</p></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground\">Library &amp; Academic</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 text-[11px]\"><li><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"/catalog\">Browse Catalog</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"/academic\">Academic Library</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:underline text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 font-bold\" href=\"/sacred-texts\">Sacred Texts</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"/collections\">Classics &amp; Literature</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:underline text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 font-bold\" href=\"/request\">Request a Book</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground\">Rights &amp; Governance</h4><ul class=\"space-y-1.5 text-[11px]\"><li><a class=\"hover:underline flex items-center gap-1\" href=\"/rights\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check w-3 h-3 text-green-600\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg> Rights &amp; Legal Policy</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"/rights#takedown\">Takedown Procedure</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"/rights#attribution\">Attribution Policy</a></li><li><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"/rights#geo\">Geographic Restrictions</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"space-y-2\"><h4 class=\"fo